From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Topher Campbell <chrs2021@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 10/16] power: supply: add the OZ8806 gauge; mt6370-charger: charging policy

oz8806_battery: the Titan Pocket's O2Micro fuel gauge (coulomb counter,
voltage, current, NTC temperature).

mt6370-charger: the input current follows the Type-C source (a supplier
named with power-supplies) and BC1.2; charge current, voltage and
termination come from the monitored battery, with end of charge enabled;
charging stops outside the battery's operating temperature range, and
while userspace sets charge_behaviour to inhibit-charge (a charge limit).
---
